#. §7: `py_prove`
#: Game/Doc.lean:29
msgid "§0 fills in the goal with the expression §1, leaving every §2\n"
"inside §3 as a new goal.\n"
"\n"
"In this game its job is handing the interpreter its fuel *by hand*:\n"
"§4 turns the claim “*some* amount of fuel makes this Python\n"
"call finish” into the concrete claim “fuel §5 does” — exactly what\n"
"§6 and §7 do for you internally. At the boss you take the\n"
"wheel yourself. Extra fuel is always harmless — a finished run keeps its\n"
"result."
msgstr ""

